; claude: the adventure kit: what adventure games share, on top of the
; playground -- the world as data (rooms, objects each somewhere, flags)
; and the player's sentences acted on it by rules (Adventure). TinyZork
; makes its sentences by parsing what is typed, TinyManiacMansion by
; clicking a verb and objects: the same model under both. A private
; library (only the games use it), installed with elm_playground for
; its API documentation.
(library
 (name kit_adventure)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
)
